  <title>Account transactions</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Accounting</gui><gui>Account transactions</gui></guiseq>, or
  the <gui>Account Transactions</gui> button of the main window, lists the
  ledger entries of one account.</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Choose the account. For a parent account, its sub-accounts are
    included.</p></item>
    <item><p>Choose the <gui>Fiscal</gui> year, or check <gui>All</gui> for
    every year.</p></item>
    <item><p>Show the entries <gui>Monthly</gui> or <gui>Daily</gui>, added up
    by month or day, or <gui>Individually</gui>, with a running
    <gui>Balance</gui>.</p></item>
  </steps>

  <p><gui>Accounts summary</gui> (<keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>N</key></keyseq>)
  lists the totals of every account instead; double click one to see its
  entries. <gui>Refresh</gui> reloads.</p>

  <p>To find out where entries came from, select several (hold
  <key>Ctrl</key>) and choose <gui>GL entry lookup</gui> from the menu that
  appears; see <link xref="gl_entry_lookup"/>.</p>

</page>
